[{"id":4250631845,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc79W36l","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I agree with the overall idea.\r\n\r\nHowever those variant methods are exposed in `gdextension_interface.cpp`. For extensions we should probably not change the behaviour, so array wrapping and unwrapping still needs to be done in `gdextension_variant_iter_init` and friends.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n> If debug is not enabled, the user is able to append items to the array and have them persist. Previously they would be discarded.\r\n\r\nIMO we should forbid that in the documentation to be future proof. This is an advanced feature so using contracts in the documentation seems appropriate to me.\r\n\r\n> Similarly, the parameter passed to _iter_get and _iter_next within a loop is the same Array instance whereas before it was always a newly created one.\r\n\r\nThe docs state nothing about this and clearly state that the array is only to be used as wrapper for pass-by-reference semantics. IMO it's fine to change the implementation details.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119080#pullrequestreview-4250631845","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119080","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119080#pullrequestreview-4250631845"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119080"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-08T08:02:40Z","commit_id":"0cb6652dc0e8d257ee72286e18ea044200eeff31"},{"id":4491202913,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC7JRYQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Seems fine to me.\n\nI did run the benchmark myself. With the removal of the variant stuff, case C is the only one I'm seeing improvements for. Still worth it though.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119080#pullrequestreview-4491202913","pull_request_url":